{"id":"3311a5322079aa93","group":"90","path":"90/90-fact-normal-system-undecidable.md","title":"fact-normal-system-undecidable — Normal Systems are Undecidable","display":"fact-normal-system-undecidable — Normal Systems are Undecidable","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-fact-normal-system-undecidable","aliases":["90-fact-normal-system-undecidable"],"display":"fact-normal-system-undecidable — Normal Systems are Undecidable","depends_on":["[[90-df-normal-system]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-decidable-theory]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-df-essentially-undecidable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-fact-normal-system-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-fact-normal-system-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-normal-system-undecidable — Normal Systems are Undecidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f93e27fe7f2babaf\" href=\"?note=f93e27fe7f2babaf\" title=\"90-df-normal-system\">90-df-normal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06f1ec898bae8895\" href=\"?note=06f1ec898bae8895\" title=\"90-df-decidable-theory\">90-df-decidable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" href=\"?note=e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" title=\"90-df-essentially-undecidable\">90-df-essentially-undecidable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\subseteq S\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\subseteq S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> 保持原算术呈示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" href=\"?note=e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" title=\"90-df-essentially-undecidable\">90-df-essentially-undecidable</a> 的子语言呈示适配，即以原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-句子集视图调用，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的三元组分量换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span> (fixed arithmetic signature and effective Gödel numbering)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (effectively axiomatized arithmetical theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span> (normal-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f93e27fe7f2babaf\" href=\"?note=f93e27fe7f2babaf\" title=\"90-df-normal-system\">90-df-normal-system</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span> (extension of Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\\)</span> (essential undecidability of the chosen base presentation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" href=\"?note=e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" title=\"90-df-essentially-undecidable\">90-df-essentially-undecidable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span> (decidable-theory predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"06f1ec898bae8895\" href=\"?note=06f1ec898bae8895\" title=\"90-df-decidable-theory\">90-df-decidable-theory</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}normal\\text{-}system\\text{-}undecidable}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}normal\\text{-}system\\text{-}undecidable}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span> 取得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\\)</span>，将其中全称量化的扩展理论取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，其余两个所需条件正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span>，直接推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>“正规”结构本身不蕴含不可判定；一致性和足够的算术强度是不可省略的条件。</li>\n<li>这里把所用基理论的本质不可判定性显式化；由其定义、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的有效公理化与一致性直接得到结论，不能仅凭“正规系统”名称跳过该桥梁。</li>\n<li>结论是定理集不可判定，不是说该形式系统的每个独立判定问题都不可解。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-normal-system","status":"resolved","id":"f93e27fe7f2babaf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-normal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"06f1ec898bae8895","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-decidable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"e3ae8bc1f7b51728","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-essentially-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"e3ae8bc1f7b51728","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\subseteq S$，$Q\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$ 保持原算术呈示；$\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)$ 使用 [[90-df-essentially-undecidable]] 的子语言呈示适配，即以原 $\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)$ 的 $S$-句子集视图调用，不把 $Q$ 的三元组分量换成 $S$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-normal-system","status":"resolved","id":"f93e27fe7f2babaf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)$ (normal-system predicate, see [[90-df-normal-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)$ (metatheoretic consistency, see [[90-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T$ (extension of Robinson arithmetic, see [[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"e3ae8bc1f7b51728","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)$ (essential undecidability of the chosen base presentation, see [[90-df-essentially-undecidable]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"06f1ec898bae8895","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)$ (decidable-theory predicate, see [[90-df-decidable-theory]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S,g","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}normal\\text{-}system\\text{-}undecidable}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}_{S,g}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2560,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive.md]]\n[[90-fact-godel-number-effective.md]]\n[[90-fact-normal-system-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-fact-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[90-fact-paradox-equivalence.md]]\n[[90-fact-proof-predicate-pr.md]]\n[[90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise.md]]"}],"outgoing":["f93e27fe7f2babaf","4e89323a1592aeb9","b7d7a03ff76428de","06f1ec898bae8895","002c574215686062","e3ae8bc1f7b51728"]}